{
  "info": {
    "name": "ms-conductores",
    "description": "Casos de prueba del Taller 2 para ms-conductores · LogiRed (1 a 18). Ejecutar en orden con Run collection: la carpeta 00 obtiene los tokens (necesita ms-usuarios en el puerto 3001), el caso 07 guarda el id que usan el 10, 12 y 13.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 Preparación (tokens)",
      "description": "Requiere ms-usuarios corriendo en el puerto 3001 con la misma JWT_SECRET. Inicia sesión como administrador, crea (una sola vez; si ya existen responde 409) un usuario de despacho y uno de flota, e inicia sesión con cada uno.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00a Login administrador",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{usuariosUrl}}/usuarios/login",
              "host": [
                "{{usuariosUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@empresa.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{passwordAdmin}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "00b Crear usuario despacho (201 o 409 si ya existe)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{usuariosUrl}}/usuarios",
              "host": [
                "{{usuariosUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "usuarios"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Usuario Despacho\",\n  \"email\": \"despacho@empresa.com\",\n  \"password\": \"{{passwordPruebas}}\",\n  \"rol\": \"despacho\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 201 o 409', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "00c Crear usuario flota (201 o 409 si ya existe)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
